              "NEH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.23.3+DEU.23.4+DEU.23.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 23.3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno gikwano cik pa Moses bot lwak wek guwiny; ci gunoŋo i dul mo ka ma gicoyo ni pe giye dano mo ma en jo Ammon kadi ki jo Moab mo me donyo i cokke pa lwak ma gin jo pa Lubaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.22.1+NUM.22.2+NUM.22.3+NUM.22.4+NUM.22.5+NUM.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 22.1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok man gicoyo pien onoŋo jo Ammon ki jo Moab yam gukwero miyo cam ki pii bot jo Icrael i kare ma gia woko ki i Ejipt. Gin guwilo Balaam me ceno jo Icrael, ento Lubaŋawa oloko cenowaŋi odoko gum botwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma jo Icrael doŋ guwinyo gikwano cik, ci gucako poko jo ma gin likwayo pa lurok woko ducu ki i kom jo Icrael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma lok man peya otimme, onoŋo ajwaka Eliacib ma yam giketo en me loyo kicika ma i ot pa Lubaŋa, omako larem gin ki Tobia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En oyu bo kicika acel malac pi Tobia, ma yam onoŋo obedo me gwoko jami macalo gityer me moko kwon ki odok luban ma gityero, jami ma gitiyo kwedgi i ot pa Lubaŋa, ki dul acel me apar me kal, koŋo vino ki moo ma yam gimiyo bot Lulevi ki luwer ki lugwok-doggola pi lubo cik, kacel ki jami me mot pi konyo ajwagi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma lokke timme onoŋo an ape i Jerucalem, pien i mwaka me pyeradek wiye aryo me loc pa Aritakcec kabaka me Babilon onoŋo acito ka tito lok man bot kabaka. I kare mo alego kabaka ni adok cen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci en oye omiyo adok cen i Jerucalem, ci cut anoŋo ni Eliacib otimo bal me ye ni Tobia obed i kicika acel i dyekal ma i ot pa Lubaŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiniga omaka matek, ci abolo jami pa Tobia me ot woko ducu ki i kicika meno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok amiyo cik cut me lonyo kicika ducu; ka doŋ acako dwoko iye jami ma gitiyo kwedgi i ot pa Lubaŋa, kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ki odok luban.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
