              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok dano mo acel i kom likwayo pa Yekoyada, wod pa Eliacib ajwaka madit, onoŋo onyomo nya pa Canbalat ma jo Bet-koron, ci aryemo en woko ki bota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai Lubaŋana, in ipo pigi, pien doŋ gubalo nyiŋgi woko me bedo ajwagi, dok bene gubalo gicikke ma iketo i kin in ki ajwagi kacel ki Lulevi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.29"
            ]
          }
